// (2026-09-03, caught by a real build) to the actual spotanim TAG, `dagannoth_spine_spotanim_travel2`
// (all.spotanim: anim=dagannoth_water_creature_spine_travel) - proj_travel needs the spotanim's own
// bracket name, same as Supreme's `dagannoth_arrow_spotanim_travel` in dagannoth_kings.npc, not the
// raw seq name nested inside it, which is what this originally (wrongly) pointed at. Defence bonuses
// aren't given by the
